# sources: SCRATCHPAD/p5l/runs/T012/a0-td-e/F.table.jsonl; /common/build-cache/vhirschi/p_integral_dev/simplify-tables/min/<T>/F.table.jsonl (header = first line)
# *.engine_first.jsonl: rr_proof instantiate (frozen 20261114T2332Z-engine-line7a, git 6c2fb15c) facts per chart via mkreq.py + condense.py
# *.check_facts.jsonl: rr_proof instantiate (frozen 20261114T2332Z-engine-line7a) answers to the import check's fact requests (split_req.py: byte offsets, one job per chart; iterate.sh)
# campaign.sh / summarize.py: the eps campaign sweep driver and its table (lane epsframe; Rust step: eps_campaign_node)
# probe_pass_SUMMARY.txt: the probe pass (box probe(weight<=3)) over 137 eps nodes, run1 2026-11-15
# boxdef_B_provisional.json: the PROVISIONAL eps-box clause of the second pass (BOXDEF.v3 B reading, Q1-Q5 open)
# boxB_provisional_*_SUMMARY.txt: second pass (provisional BOXDEF B box, budget 200k) and the budget-1.5M pass of its 17 Tier-K-only nodes
# boxdef_B_answered_v1.json (coordinator answers Q1-Q5, tagged), boxdef_B_census_rule.json (lane basis-census rule, cross-check), census_band_sizes.py, boxB_answered_vs_census_comparison.json
